&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-5608-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. A re-engineered designation of &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/object-classes#toc9&quot;&gt;the defunct object class&lt;/a&gt; of the same name.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-5608-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Original text: Ты - аномалия, опухоль миров&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-5608-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Some translation errors may persist; informed readers are welcome to update a foreign class&#039; definition if they have the consent of the author or are otherwise certain of a better definition.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-5608-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. Original text: Атлант&lt;/div&gt;
