&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;RAISA REVISION FILTRATOR:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Revisions Have Been Highlighted, Redundant Information Omitted&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-4704&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;Euclid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedure:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;All SCP-4704 instances are to be transported to storage containment hangar 92-Δ of Area-92 located in Talamanca, Costa Rica. All personnel currently associated to SCP-4704 research team are now assigned to Area-92. HDD&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-656734-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; monitors remain active within these buildings at all times. If a fluctuation in Hume level is detected, agents are to pin-point instances responsible and remove them for examination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;When several instances are simultaneously activated, designated a cluster-activation&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-656734-2&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;, combined frequencies emitted will increase in strength. Cluster-activations produce significant hume field discrepancies, and the resulting modifications are severe, affecting a radius of up to 4000 meters. Recorded alterations include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;Rapid growth of vegetation native to the South American region including many species of flora, trees, and foliage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;Terrain deformation and seismic activity of a maximum magnitude of 7-8.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;Violent atmospheric disturbance and inconsistent meteorological shifts, usually resulting in tropical storms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;Atmospheric and sedimentary purification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;Gradual accumulation of anomalously manifested fresh water into a large singular body.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;Changes persist despite the cease of sonorous stimulation and are non reversible via standard methods.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;Addendum 4704.01:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Test Log-064&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following is the first successfully recorded cluster-activation. After an extensive operation to publicly conceal incident, containment of SCP-4704 has been adjusted, including the construction of subterranean specialized containment area designated Area-92 to house all known instances of SCP-4704, and function as hub for SCP-4704 research team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4704 TEST LOG-164:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Subjects Tested:&lt;/strong&gt; 4704-048, 4704-004, 4704-113&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Position Adjustment:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-4704-004 rotated 45° clockwise from prior position&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Object #:&lt;/strong&gt; 028&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Object:&lt;/strong&gt; Wooden Flute With Internal Wind Channel Of Native American Craft&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Procedure:&lt;/strong&gt; D-15302 instructed to enter test chamber containing SCP-4704-048, -004, and -113 positioned in a acute triangle. D-15302 instructed to approach the center of containment chamber and to play a constant High G note.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Effects:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;00:00:45&lt;/em&gt;- Foliage completely overtakes chamber floor and walls.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;00:01:20&lt;/em&gt;- Instances of &lt;em&gt;Cedrela odorata&lt;/em&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-656734-3&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Schizolobium parahyba&lt;/em&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-656734-4&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; sprout through floor and rapidly mature, penetrating roof of chamber.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;00:02:02&lt;/em&gt;- Terrain of site begins to shift.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;00:02:10&lt;/em&gt;- D-15302 has ceased playing High G note, however alterations continue.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;00:03:15&lt;/em&gt;- Foliage beings to extend to rest of facility.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;00:06:10&lt;/em&gt;- Foliage extends to exterior of site and beyond.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;00:06:32&lt;/em&gt;- Weather patterns begin to fluctuate, producing heavy winds and rain.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;00:06:58&lt;/em&gt;- Small body of water begins to generate 1000&amp;#160;m the north of site.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;00:07:13&lt;/em&gt;- Region experiences seismic tremor.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;00:07:49&lt;/em&gt;- Seismic disturbances result in small protruding rupture of terrain within facility.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;00:08:01&lt;/em&gt;- Smoke escapes from rupture.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;00:08:09&lt;/em&gt;- D-15302 ordered to displace SCP-4704 instances&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;00:08:13&lt;/em&gt;- D-15302 does as instructed. Modifications subside.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Results:&lt;/strong&gt; Damage to structural integrity of Site 92. SCP-4704 affecting public vicinity. Containment breach of SCP-████ , SCP-████ , SCP-████ , and SCP-████.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-center&quot; style=&quot;width:400px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/inbox/Damage&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/inbox/Damage/medium.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:400px;&quot; alt=&quot;Damage&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
