&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gabe, if you&#039;re reading this, Isaac managed to get the drive to you. I trust him, I hope you do too. They obviously screen everything that gets sent. I considered just giving it to you in person, too risky. Burn the note after you read it, I&#039;d rather not be terminated due to idiotic curiosity and stubbornness. I hate you for turning me on to this, but I owe it to you enough to share what I found.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m not sure what to believe anymore.&lt;/p&gt;
