&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-656734-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Spanish cedar&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-656734-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Gallinazo tree&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-656734-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. See &lt;em&gt;Addendum 4704.01: Incident Report 4704-ö̀&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
