&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-656734-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. See Addendum 4704.02: Findings Report&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-656734-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. See Addendum 4704.01: Containment Committee Proposal&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-656734-9&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;9&lt;/a&gt;. See MD Publication: &lt;em&gt;Reality Bent: The Adverse Effects On Mental Health When Exposed To Hume Field Discrepancy&lt;/em&gt; pp 002-017&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-656734-10&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;. Reality Perception Resistance Examination; See MD Publication: &lt;em&gt;Reality Bent: The Adverse Effects On Mental Health When Exposed To Hume Field Discrepancy&lt;/em&gt; pp 304-330&lt;/div&gt;
