&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;ACCESS&amp;nbsp;GRANTED&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;display: inline-block; border-radius: 10px; border:dashed 1px #444444; background:#F5F5F5; float:top; width:96.5%; padding:10px&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INCIDENT REPORT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INCIDENT #:&lt;/strong&gt; 5810-001&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;DATE OF OCCURRENCE:&lt;/strong&gt; 7/23/12&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&lt;br /&gt;
On 7/23/27, D-2227 and D-9101 participated in a test involving the SCP-5810-1 instance&lt;br /&gt;
manifested within Site-83. They were to attempt to exit the instance with a product that they had&lt;br /&gt;
not purchased. There was no unusual activity until D-2227 and D-9101 attempted to exit the&lt;br /&gt;
instance, following test procedure. Two SCP-5810-2 instances in the attire of security officers&lt;br /&gt;
manifested and grasped their clothing. They were violently moved to the entrance of the butchery&lt;br /&gt;
and moved inside. The interior housed heavy machinery and containers of unknown liquid. D-&lt;br /&gt;
2227 was violently forced to enter the machinery. D-9101, though resisting for a minute&lt;br /&gt;
and 57 seconds and successfully neutralizing one of the SCP-5810-2 instances, is also violently forced&lt;br /&gt;
into the machinery. Both D-2227&#039;s and D-9101&#039;s video and audio feeds cease once entering the&lt;br /&gt;
machinery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Products containing the DNA of D-2227 and D-9101 were discovered three weeks later in the&lt;br /&gt;
products of a SCP-5810-1 instance located in São Paulo, Brazil.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
